<article class="env-example" id="0H80">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0H80">Example <span data-tag="0H80">15.65.5</span>.</a> If $R = \mathbf{Z}$ or more generally if $R$ is a Dedekind domain, then $\text{Tor}_ i^ R(M, N) = 0$ for $i \not\in \{ 0, 1\} $ for all $R$-modules $M$ and $N$. Hence the spectral sequence of Lemma <a href="/tag/0H7Z" data-tag="0H7Z">15.65.4</a> degenerates at the $E_2$ page and we get short exact sequences </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  0 \to \bigoplus _{i + j = n} H^ i(K) \otimes _ R H^ j(L) \to H^ n(K \otimes _ R^\mathbf {L} L) \to \bigoplus _{i + j = n + 1} \text{Tor}^ R_1(H^ i(K), H^ j(L)) \to 0  \]
</div>
  <p> for all $n \in \mathbf{Z}$. </p>
</article>